Run a strap command with STRAP_SESSION set.

Usage:
  strap with-session <session-name-or-path> <command> [args...]

Examples:
  strap with-session dev-agent env
  strap with-session dev-agent strap session path

The selector may be an absolute session path, an exact session directory name, or a unique substring of a session directory under `$STRAP_WORK/sessions`.

This is a one-command override and does not change `$STRAP_WORK/sessions/current`.
